WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.140
When your child earns an award or certificate at the centre, it appears here.

2
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:13.000
Open any award to see the certificate with your child's name, and tap Print or Save to keep a copy.

3
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:21.060
Report cards from the centre show up the same way, and your educators' observations build into a record of your child's year.
